  "title": "The RealReal Reopens its Flagship San Francisco Store in Union Square for Shopping and Consignment",
  "summary": "The RealReal (Nasdaq: REAL), the world’s largest marketplace for authenticated luxury resale, today announced the reopening of its San Francisco flagship store in the heart of Union Square — reaffirming the company’s deep roots in the city where it was founded and its commitment to San Francisco’s downtown revival. The store officially opens on Thursday, February 26 , at 11:00 a.m. PT for consignment and shopping. The reopening marks The RealReal’s 17th retail location nationwide and introduces",
